  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: out-of-bounds write on bz2 decompressor and BZ2File reuse\n     after a decompression error\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-9669.patch: make a libbz2 decompression error\n       sticky on the decompressor object and on the BZ2File read paths in\n       Modules/bz2module.c, so a reused object can no longer re-enter\n       BZ2_bzDecompress() on an errored stream and write out of bounds\n     - CVE-2026-9669",
